        "body": "The particle まで means 'until' when used with a time expression and a verb describing an ongoing action. For example, 8時までテレビを見る means 'watch TV until 8 o'clock.' In contrast, までに means 'by' and is used to express that an action is completed before a certain time. For example, 8時までに終わる means 'finish by 8 o'clock'.",
